{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 11,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        105.94963836669922,
        219.73651123046875,
        147.5496368408203
      ],
      "text": "Definitions",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.91859436035156,
        527.556396484375,
        195.36158752441406
      ],
      "text": "The definitions below apply to terms as used in these guidelines, and they may have different",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.1186065673828,
        166.2939910888672,
        208.5615997314453
      ],
      "text": "meanings elsewhere.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        215.5586395263672,
        527.5050048828125,
        230.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "Active (tuberculosis) case-finding (ACF) : Provider-initiated screening and testing in communities",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.98523998260498,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.0225372314453,
        527.3869018554688,
        243.4655303955078
      ],
      "text": "by mobile teams, often using mobile X-ray and rapid molecular tests. The term is sometimes used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.22254943847656,
        262.96685791015625,
        256.6655578613281
      ],
      "text": "synonymously with “systematic screening”.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.66253662109375,
        527.4330444335938,
        278.3695373535156
      ],
      "text": "Computer-aided detection (CAD):  The use of specialized software to interpret abnormalities on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.12652587890625,
        527.4278564453125,
        291.5695495605469
      ],
      "text": "chest radiographs that are suggestive of TB. The results are expressed as abnormality scores. CAD",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.32647705078125,
        237.2327117919922,
        304.7695007324219
      ],
      "text": "may be used for screening or triage.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.76641845703125,
        527.5059204101562,
        326.4734191894531
      ],
      "text": "Enhanced (tuberculosis) case-finding : Health information or education, or awareness campaigns",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.985039710998535,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.23040771484375,
        527.603759765625,
        339.6734313964844
      ],
      "text": "to provide information about what type of health-seeking behaviour is appropriate when people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.430419921875,
        527.4299926757812,
        352.8734436035156
      ],
      "text": "experience symptoms of TB; this type of case-finding may be combined with improving access to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.6304016113281,
        477.647216796875,
        366.07342529296875
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic services. Enhanced case-finding may or may not be combined with screening.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.0703430175781,
        527.4151000976562,
        387.77734375
      ],
      "text": "Initial screening : The first screening test, examination or other procedure applied in the population",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.993398666381836,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        386.5343933105469,
        168.481689453125,
        400.9774169921875
      ],
      "text": "eligible for screening.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        407.9743347167969,
        527.440185546875,
        422.68133544921875
      ],
      "text": "Number needed to screen (NNS) : The number of persons that need to undergo screening in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.43829345703125,
        284.00628662109375,
        435.8813171386719
      ],
      "text": "order to diagnose one person with TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.87823486328125,
        527.4024047851562,
        457.5852355957031
      ],
      "text": "Passive case-finding : A patient-initiated pathway to TB diagnosis involving: (1) a person with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.3421936035156,
        527.524169921875,
        470.78521728515625
      ],
      "text": "disease who experiences symptoms that he or she recognizes as serious; (2) the person having access",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977527618408203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.5422058105469,
        527.2262573242188,
        483.9852294921875
      ],
      "text": "to and seeking care, and presenting spontaneously at an appropriate health facility; (3) a health worker",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961281776428223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.7422180175781,
        527.4400634765625,
        497.18524169921875
      ],
      "text": "correctly assessing that the person fulfils the criteria for presumptive TB; and (4) successful use of a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        495.94219970703125,
        420.9192199707031,
        510.3852233886719
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic algorithm with sufficient sensitivity and specificity to diagnose TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.3822631835938,
        464.8355712890625,
        532.0892333984375
      ],
      "text": "Repeat screening : This refers to rescreening the same population at a given interval.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.0861206054688,
        527.37060546875,
        553.7930908203125
      ],
      "text": "Risk groups : Any group of people in which the prevalence or incidence of TB is significantly higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.5501098632812,
        212.80421447753906,
        566.9931030273438
      ],
      "text": "than in the general population.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.9900512695312,
        527.4234008789062,
        588.697021484375
      ],
      "text": "Screening test, examination or procedure for tuberculosis disease : A test, examination, or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.4539794921875,
        527.435546875,
        601.89697265625
      ],
      "text": "other procedure used to distinguish people with a high likelihood of having TB disease from people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.6539916992188,
        527.4266967773438,
        615.0969848632812
      ],
      "text": "who are highly unlikely to have TB. A screening test is not intended to be diagnostic. People with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.85400390625,
        527.3848876953125,
        628.2969970703125
      ],
      "text": "positive results on a screening test should undergo further evaluation, depending on the screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.0540161132812,
        142.29139709472656,
        641.4970092773438
      ],
      "text": "algorithm used.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.4940185546875,
        527.321533203125,
        663.2009887695312
      ],
      "text": "Second screening : A second screening test, examination or other procedure undergone by persons",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.980883598327637,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.9580078125,
        307.3759765625,
        676.4010009765625
      ],
      "text": "whose results were positive during the initial screen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.39794921875,
        527.37646484375,
        698.1049194335938
      ],
      "text": "Systematic screening for TB disease : The systematic identification of people at risk for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.8619384765625,
        527.3926391601562,
        711.304931640625
      ],
      "text": "disease, in a predetermined target group, by assessing symptoms and using tests, examinations or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        710.0618896484375,
        527.4144287109375,
        724.5048828125
      ],
      "text": "other procedures that can be applied rapidly. For those who screen positive, the diagnosis needs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        723.2619018554688,
        527.428955078125,
        737.7048950195312
      ],
      "text": "to be established by one or several diagnostic tests and additional clinical assessments. This term is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.4619140625,
        527.4212036132812,
        750.9049072265625
      ],
      "text": "sometimes used interchangeably with “active tuberculosis case-finding”. It should be distinguished",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.6619262695312,
        425.90936279296875,
        764.1049194335938
      ],
      "text": "from testing for TB infection (with a TB skin test or interferon-g release assay).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        489.3196105957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        552.4254150390625,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Definitions ix",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}